"""The benchmark harness. Only its scenario corpus is a Bazel input.

`crates/bench-driver`'s `scenario_files` suite loads every file below through
the driver's own `Scenario` type, so a scenario that stops parsing names
itself. Everything else here -- the manifests, the Terraform, the scripts and
the justfile -- drives a live Kubernetes cluster and has no Bazel target.
"""

package(default_visibility = ["//visibility:public"])

filegroup(
    name = "scenarios",
    srcs = glob(["scenarios/*.yaml"]),
)
